---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Import skills from supported agent directories

Usage: bento skills import [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Enable debug logging: each smolvm call, and SMOLBENTO_LOG at info unless set

      --dry-run
          Preview which skills would be imported without copying anything

  -f, --force
          Overwrite existing skills without prompting

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -v, --verbose
          Also list the checked directories that do not exist

  -h, --help
          Print help
